  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nWhen you're 28, science discovers a drug that stops all effects of aging, creating immortality. Your government decides to give the drug to all citizens under 26, but you and the rest of the “Lost Generations\" are deemed too high-risk. When you're 85, the side effects are finally discovered. It turns out that after a few decades the minds of those who have taken the drug begin slowly regressing to a childlike state. This regression doesn't happen at the same speed as a child's mental development only in reverse, it's a much slower process.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 12,
  "reference_text": " However, slowly but surely, all the young people are becoming more childlike in their thinking and behavior. There is a panic and the government is at a loss as to how to deal with this unprecedented crisis. The government decides to take the drug away from the young people, but this only makes the problem worse.",
